SUMMARY:A Concert Celebration: 20 Years at the Four Seasons + Dinner (Osgo
 ode Station)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\nOn **Thursday September 17th\, join us for
  A Concert Celebration: 20 Years at the Four Seasons Centre for the Perfor
 ming Arts.** Celebrate 20 remarkable years of the Four Seasons Centre for 
 the Performing Arts with a special one-night-only concert honouring our ic
 onic home in the heart of downtown Toronto. Musical highlights will includ
 e the fanfare that opened the Four Seasons Centre’s inaugural season in 
 2006\, as well as Beethoven’s soaring Symphony No. 9. An all-Canadian ca
 st of soloists features soprano **Aviva Fortunata**\, mezzo-soprano **Aria
 na Maubach**\, tenor **Matthew Cairns**\, and bass-baritone **Alex Hallida
 y**. My seat is Orchestra Ring\, Row CC Seat 142. **Purchase A Concert Cel
 ebration: 20 Years at the Four Seasons Centre for the Performing Arts on S
 eptember 17th at 7:30pm.**\n\n**COST**\nRegular: $35 - $175 + fees\n\nMeet
 up fee: $5\n\nTicket Policy: Sales are final and non-refundable.\n\n**SIGN
 ING-UP**\n\n* **Simply RSVP Yes (everyone goes on the waitlist) confirming
  if you will join for dinner prior (reservations required).**\n* **Once yo
 u [purchase](https://my.coc.ca/2598/2599?_gl=1*1hq2q98*_gcl_au*MTQ1NzI0MTE
 wNy4xNzg0MzIzMTEz) your ticket and post your seat number\, I will move you
  to attending.**\n* A reminder will go out the day before with my cell and
  details when to meet\, etc.\n\n‐‐----‐----‐‐-------------‐---
 --------\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet me for dinner at: 5:30pm at The Keg at 1
 65 York St.**\n\n**Meet me at: 7:15pm** **along the right glass wall\, aft
 er scanning your tickets and entering The Four Seasons Centre for the Perf
 orming Arts at 145 Queen St. W.**\n\n**Start time: 7:30pm**\n\nLength: 1+ 
 hours\n\nEnjoy and please post your Comments after!
