SUMMARY:Virtual REGISTER: Free Women's Masterclass - Your Permission Slip 
 to...
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\n**Note: This is for Women only (sorry guys
 ). After you RSVP\, you will also need to Register to receive your link to
  the event.**\n\nOn **Wednesday\, September 21st\,** **join me for A free 
 women’s wellness masterclass - Your permission slip to stop existing\, a
 nd start living.**\nYou've been waiting for permission.\n\n* Permission to
  rest without earning it.\n* Permission to say no without the guilt spiral
 .\n* Permission to want more\, even when your life looks good on paper.\n\
 nHere's the thing\, though - nobody else is coming to give it to you. The 
 only signature that was ever required on that slip is YOURS.\n\nIn one gui
 ded session\, you'll walk away with:\n\n* The exact permission you've been
  withholding from yourself\, named and specific to you.\n* Clarity on whos
 e voice has been running your inherited rulebook all these years.\n* The t
 ruth about why waiting feels safe when it's really just well-disguised avo
 idance.\n* A real glimpse of the woman already forming underneath your eve
 ryday life.\n* And the signature moment\, where you write your permission 
 on an actual piece of paper\, sign it\, date it\, and make it official.\n\
 nPlus the piece nobody teaches. Why will power alone never holds\, and wha
 t actually does.\n\nOne session. One signed piece of paper. A completely d
 ifferent way of moving through your life.\n\nThat's exactly what our free 
 Your Permission Slip masterclass is about.\n\n**COST**\nFree\n\n**SIGNING 
 UP**\n\n* Simply RSVP Yes\n* **[Register](https://soulfullevents.com/maste
 rclass/?fbclid=IwY2xjawUGivNwZG9mBWV4dG4DYWVtAjEwAGJyaWQRMUNLampiSXIyZzJEZ
 UdRQUNzcnRjBmFwcF9pZBAyMjIwMzkxNzg4MjAwODkyAAEeuUkfdvteTjVVJMlv09Fe3SG7KF-
 t73KJoamJaC3swncSDSnWlcnLvq6pu7Y_aem_WHOK7R6LSvRIsCxKJdeeLA)** for the tal
 k and you will receive a confirmation email and a second email with your z
 oom link to the event\n* **Start time: 6:30pm when you will click on link 
 provided directly to you**\n* Length: estimate 1 - 2 hours\n* RSVPs close 
 2 days prior to start time\, hoping spots are still available\n*\n\nEnjoy 
 and please post your Comments after!
