SUMMARY:Free Open House & Concert at the Toronto Symphony + Lunch (St Andr
 ew Stn.)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\nOn **Saturday September 26th\,** join us f
 or an **Open House and Free Concert at The Toronto Symphony Orchestra (TSO
 **)**.** Traditionally\, we have only gone for the concert\, but we will b
 e doing both this year and members can choose any part to join. **This yea
 r the Open House will not only have Live musicians/ guests playing\, we wi
 ll also be able to do a Self-guided Tour of the Hall\, Compose a short pie
 ce and hear it performed on the spot\, Try out instruments and More.** We 
 will then go for Lunch across the street\, and return later to join the **
 Rush Line for the Concert**. I believe we will be successful as it was 60%
  full for the concert last year and members had no problems getting in wit
 hout a ticket. **Note: You may also choose to Register for confirmed conce
 rt tickets starting at 2pm**\, **using the purple register link below** (c
 urrently sold out and tickets unlikely to become available).\n\n**PROGRAM*
 *\nNot available at event posting time\n\n**ACCESSIBILITY**: please contac
 t Patron Services at 416.598.3375 to reserve your tickets.\n\n‐‐----
 ‐----‐‐-------------‐-----------\n\n**COST**\n\nOpen House & Conce
 rt: Free\n\nMeetup organizer Fee: $5\n\n‐‐----‐----‐‐-----------
 --‐-----------\n\n**SIGNING-UP**\n\n**Simply RSVP Yes confirming if you'
 re joining for Open House\, Lunch\, and/or Concert**\n\n**[Register for yo
 ur free concert ticket](https://www.tso.ca/concerts-and-events/open-house-
 and-free-concert?utm_source=wordfly&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=2526-Ope
 nHouse-Sep8&utm_content=version_A)**\n\nRSVPs close Friday\, cancellations
  after will be marked as a No Show.\n\nA reminder will be sent the day bef
 ore with my cell and details to attend.\n‐‐----‐----‐‐----------
 ---‐-----------\n\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet me at: 10:45am in the line** 
 **outside the Box Office at Roy Thomson Hall at 60 Simcoe St. (southwest c
 orner) to go in together**\n\n**Meet me at: 11:45am INSIDE the double glas
 s doors to the right side where we entered to head out for lunch**\n\n**Me
 et members in the Rush Line starting at: 1pm in the line** **outside the B
 ox Office at Roy Thomson Hall at 60 Simcoe St. (southwest corner) to go in
  together.**\n\n**There will be a bag check - larger bags\, opened water b
 ottles and outside food not allowed.**\n\n**Concert starts: 2pm**\n\nConce
 rt Length: 60 minutes\n\nEnjoy and please post your Comments in the event 
 after - thanks!
