SUMMARY:Verdi's Timeless La Traviata Opera (Osgoode Station)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\nOn **Saturday October 4th\,** **join us fo
 r La Traviata at The Canadian Opera Company.** Hailed as “the very best 
 that the world of opera can offer”\, director Arin Arbus’ production h
 as been winning the hearts of audiences ever since its original COC appear
 ance. Packed with unforgettable musical moments\, from the ebullient "Libi
 amo ne' lieti calici" (“Let’s drink from the joyful cups”)\, to the 
 passionate ode to freedom "Sempre libera" (“Forever free”)\, Verdi’s
  tale of impossible romance captures the intoxicating joy and heartbreakin
 g sacrifice at the heart of a timeless drama. See why *La Traviata* remain
 s one of the composer’s most celebrated works—and why popular lore has
  it that\, over the last century\, this opera has been performed somewhere
  in the world every single night! My seat is Orchestra Ring\, Row CC\, Sea
 t 135. **Purchase La Traviata on Sunday October 4th at 2pm\, and join us f
 or a lovely Dinner for Experience Toronto's 7th Anniversary after.**\n\n**
 LANGUAGE**: Sung in Italian with English and French SURTITLES™\n\n**COST
 **\nRegular: $35 - $400 + fees\n\nRush: A limited number of low-price tick
 ets (limited to two per person) will be available for purchase online at n
 oon for matinee performances at coc.ca (please ask for code) or 11am in pe
 rson at the Four Seasons Centre Box Office at 145 Queen St. W. All rush ti
 cket sales are final and cannot be refunded\, exchanged or replaced.\n\nSt
 anding Room: Approximately 60 are available in-person at 11 a.m. on the da
 y of a performance for just $15! They are located in the back rows of Ring
  3 (some may be SURTITLES™ obstructed) and Ring 4\, each with a hook and
  a leaning rail.\n\nMeetup fee: $5\n\nTicket Policy: Sales are final and n
 on-refundable.\n\n**SIGNING-UP**\n\n* **Simply RSVP Yes\, [purchase](https
 ://my.coc.ca/2519/2528) your ticket and post your seat number and I will m
 ove you to attending.**\n* If you plan to buy RUSH\, please state that in 
 your RSVP\, so I can include you in the reminder so you have the opportuni
 ty to meet us.\n* RSVPs close 1 day prior\, and cancellations after will r
 esult in a No Show and impact future attendance.\n* A reminder will go out
  the day before with my cell and details when to meet\, etc.\n\n‐‐----
 ‐----‐‐-------------‐-----------\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**Meet me at: 1
 :45pm** **along the right glass wall\, after scanning your tickets and ent
 ering The Four Seasons Centre for the Performing Arts at 145 Queen St. W.*
 *\n\n**Start time: 2pm**\n\nLength: 2 hours 55 mins (incl. an intermission
 )\n\nEnjoy and please post your Comments after!
